<title>HUNGARY: CESI index closes down by 0.81 pct at 1,487.95 pts.</title>
<headline>CESI index closes down by 0.81 pct at 1,487.95 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index dropped 0.81 points to end at 1,487.95 points on Tuesday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungrian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
